Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: thin wrapper for clang
 Opencl-clang is a thin wrapper library around clang. It has an
 OpenCL-oriented API and is capable of compiling OpenCL C kernels
 to SPIR-V modules.

